    "detailed_description": "Zombies again......<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThey still haven't disappeared? Looks like you wasn't efficient enough. The indie-casual game of Destroy All Zombies comes to finally close this stage. Your mission is to destroy zombies that have remained hidden with the help of a slingshot. Aim well to knock down as many as possible in one throw. <br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe magic skull will destroy them instantly, you just have to hit them. The idea seems simple, but how well will you manage?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nGame Features :<br />\r\n- 2 modes (Easy / Hard)<br />\r\n- Zombies hiding behind stones/wood<br />\r\n- Magic skull slingshot",
